/backup
/Change-Review
# OneDrive sync conflict copies.
# When OneDrive hits a conflict it keeps one version under the real filename
# and parks the other as "<name>-<COMPUTERNAME>.<ext>". Those are never source:
# committing one would put a stale duplicate of a real file in the tree, next
# to the file it duplicates. This repo lives inside a synced OneDrive folder,
# which is the underlying problem; this only stops the symptom reaching git.
*-DESKTOP-*
*-LAPTOP-*
*[-_]conflicted[-_]copy*
/docs